   "html": "<section class=\"block card structure-card\"><h2>Market structure &amp; leverage <span class=\"tag\">rule-of-thumb</span></h2><p class=\"sec-story\">Structure neutral: no clear weekly trend — range-bound.</p><div class=\"struct-grid\"><div class=\"struct-col\"><div class=\"label\">Crypto market structure</div><div class=\"struct-chip neutral\">Neutral</div><div class=\"chg\">BTC 7d +0.7% · 30d -4.0%</div><div class=\"mean\">No clear weekly trend.</div></div><div class=\"struct-col\"><div class=\"label\">Futures <abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Open interest: total value of open futures positions. Falling OI = leverage being cleared out.\" tabindex=\"0\">OI</abbr> vs price</div><div class=\"quad-grid\"><div class=\"quad-cell\"><span class=\"q-name\">Spot Rally</span><span class=\"q-hint\">OI↓ price↑ · healthy</span></div><div class=\"quad-cell active\"><span class=\"q-name\">Leveraged Rally</span><span class=\"q-hint\">OI↑ price↑ · fragile</span></div><div class=\"quad-cell\"><span class=\"q-name\">Deleveraging Sell-Off</span><span class=\"q-hint\">OI↓ price↓ · flush</span></div><div class=\"quad-cell\"><span class=\"q-name\">Leveraged Sell-Off</span><span class=\"q-hint\">OI↑ price↓ · pressure</span></div></div><div class=\"src-link\"><a href=\"https://charts.checkonchain.com/btconchain/derivatives/derivatives_futuresoi_vs_price_scatter/derivatives_futuresoi_vs_price_scatter_dark.html\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">CheckOnChain · Futures OI vs Price</a></div></div></div><div class=\"sig-grid\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"hm sig-watch\"><div class=\"lbl\">Futures positioning</div><div class=\"val word\">Leveraged Rally</div><div class=\"chg\">OI 7d +3.2%</div><span class=\"sig watch\">🟡 Leverage building</span><div class=\"mean\">Futures OI +3.2% WoW: rally fuelled by new leverage.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos\"><div class=\"lbl\">Funding</div><div class=\"val word\">+5.3% ann.</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Calm</span><div class=\"mean\">Normal, mild long bias.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-pos\"><div class=\"lbl\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Market value vs. realized value: price compared with the average cost basis of all coins. Above 1 = holders in profit on average.\" tabindex=\"0\">MVRV</abbr></div><div class=\"val word\">1.56</div><span class=\"sig pos\">🟢 Moderate profit</span><div class=\"mean\">Holders in profit but not overheated.</div></div><div class=\"hm sig-watch\"><div class=\"lbl\"><abbr class=\"gl\" title=\"Spent output profit ratio: are coins being sold at a profit (&gt;1) or loss (&lt;1)?\" tabindex=\"0\">SOPR</abbr></div><div class=\"val word\">1.019</div><span class=\"sig watch\">🟡 Profit-taking rising</span><div class=\"mean\">Coins moving at a profit, above the 7d average.</div></div></div></section>"
