   "html": "<section class=\"block card xpulse-card\"><h2>X analyst pulse <span class=\"tag\">X · Oct 22</span></h2><div class=\"xp-verdict warn\"><div class=\"xp-verdict-main\"><span class=\"xp-verdict-lbl\">Crowd read</span><span class=\"xp-verdict-txt\">Analysts lean <strong>cautious</strong></span></div><div class=\"xp-verdict-meta\"><span class=\"xp-count pos\">1 bullish</span><span class=\"xp-count warn\">3 neutral</span><span class=\"xp-count neg\">2 bearish</span><span class=\"src-chip agree\">Agrees with our Cautious regime</span></div></div><ul class=\"xp-list\"><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113012666977673670\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113012666977673670.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Bitcoin treasury companies sit on a cost basis of about $80K and are in profit, but they are barely buying right now.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113012666977673670\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 22</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113012666977673670\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2112915703736959469\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112915703736959469.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">BTC is boxed between $80K and $87K, with ETF and treasury cost basis as support and break-even sellers plus liquidation clusters as the ceiling.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2112915703736959469\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 21</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2112915703736959469\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112882363730637247\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112882363730637247.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig pos\">Bullish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Supply in profit recovered to 14.11 million BTC from under 11 million, just below the 14.19 million accumulation threshold.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112882363730637247\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 21</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112882363730637247\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112812928210526430\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112812928210526430.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">A bull score index slipped from 80 to 60 since late September; momentum stays positive while it holds above 60.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112812928210526430\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 21</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112812928210526430\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112805661834715389\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112805661834715389.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Short-term whales' paper profit halved from $9.8 billion to $4.6 billion, and they sent 10.6K BTC to exchanges on October 20.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112805661834715389\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 21</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112805661834715389\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112785742573257176\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112785742573257176.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Binance stablecoin reserves fell to a one-year low of $41.6B, with $6.3B gone since April, so fresh buying power on exchanges is thin.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112785742573257176\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 21</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2112785742573257176\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
